---

Third-party components used at runtime (not bundled in this repository):

  piano-transcription-inference  (ByteDance)  MIT
      https://pypi.org/project/piano-transcription-inference/
      Model weights are downloaded by that package from Zenodo at first run.
      This repository does NOT redistribute the weights.

  PyTorch                 BSD-3-Clause
  librosa                 ISC
  soundfile               BSD-3-Clause
  mido                    MIT
  numpy                   BSD-3-Clause
  ffmpeg (external CLI)   LGPL-2.1+ / GPL depending on the build

The 15-key note layout implemented in `sky15/layout.py` is the standard
instrument layout used by the game Sky: Children of the Light. It is a game
mechanic re-implemented from observation; no game assets are included.
The SMC sheet format handled in `sky15/smc.py` is a de-facto plain-text format
used by several community sheet players.
